@startuml implement-milestone-loop
' /loop implement-milestone <milestone>: cold-start research phase + execute phase.
' Source: .claude/commands/implement-milestone.md
title /loop implement-milestone <milestone>

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF8DC

start

if (milestone argument resolves to exactly one\ndocs/roadmap/{NNNN}-*/ with a plan.md?) then (no)
  :stop, ask user\n(spec authoring is app-architect's job);
  stop
endif

if (cursor implement-milestone-{slug}.json exists?) then (no)
  partition "Phase R - cold-start research (once per run)" {
    :R1 **Explore** digests plan.md -> JSON\n(tasks, dependency graph, contract anchors,\nsecurity markers, exit gates);
    :R2 classify status.md;
    if (state?) then (COMPLETE)
      :spot-verify a sample,\nreport standing;
      stop
    elseif () then (DIVERGED)
      :load Notes & decisions into `decisions`\n(they override plan specs);
    elseif () then (NEW)
      :create status.md skeleton if missing;
    else (IN PROGRESS)
      :trust Complete rows provisionally;
    endif
    :R3 as-built probes per non-complete task;
    if (artifacts present but shaped differently?) then (yes)
      :divergence protocol\n(see note); <<#FFE4E1>>
    elseif (present and matching?) then (yes)
      :mark task for subtask-verifier,\nnot implementation;
    else (absent)
    endif
    :R4 decomposition audit;
    if (missing decomposition for promised scope?) then (yes)
      :**app-architect** authors missing spec files;
    elseif (contract ambiguity / new scope?) then (yes)
      :AskUserQuestion;
    endif
    :record each gap in status.md Notes & decisions;
    :R5 write cursor: task_queue (dependency-ordered),\nresearch_digest (anchors only), decisions;
  }
endif

partition "Execute phase - one subtask per iteration" {
  :M1 load cursor (~400 tokens);
  :M2 select task: current_task, else first pending\nwhose depends_on are all complete;
  if (pending tasks but none eligible?) then (yes)
    :stop, surface dependency graph\n(cycle or blocked deferral);
    stop
  endif
  if (entering a security_sensitive task?) then (yes)
    :**security-auditor** on task spec\nbefore first subtask;
  endif
  :M3 run implement-subtasks **Steps 2-6**\n(+ shared-contracts anchor in briefing);
  if (any implement-subtasks stop condition?) then (yes)
    :stop the WHOLE milestone loop;
    stop
  endif
  :README row edit + cursor refresh;
  :status.md row edit after EVERY subtask\ne.g. "In progress (3/6 subtasks)";

  if (task complete?) then (yes)
    :M4 full suite, /pr-review LGTM,\nstatus.md row -> Complete;
    :append "### Task {TT.t}" detail\n(Delivered + Tests/gate) from cursor;
    :Reconciliation note if as-built diverged;
    :mark complete, clear current_task, /compact;
  endif

  if (all tasks complete or ratified-deferred?) then (yes)
    :M5 run exit gates:\n1. pytest --cov=flakeforge\n2. ruff check .\n3. flakeforge check --select X001,X009,X010 src\n4. python -m build\n5. wheel-smoke (if CLI/config/exit codes/providers touched)\n+ lockstep gates if triggered;
    if (gate failed?) then (yes)
      :stop, surface failing gate\n(do NOT flip status);
      stop
    endif
    :/link-check docs/roadmap/;
    :final status.md pass, roadmap index flip;
    :delete cursor, print closing summary;
    stop
  else (no)
    :M6 ScheduleWakeup\nprompt = /loop implement-milestone <milestone>\ndelaySeconds = 270;
    end
  endif
}

note right
  **Divergence protocol** (contract-level only)
  1. pause affected work
  2. AskUserQuestion: follow spec vs. ratify as-built
  3. record ruling in status.md + cursor decisions
  4. re-audit downstream tasks; app-architect amends specs
  Exit codes / config precedence / rule codes / extension
  surface rulings also need CHANGELOG + CLAUDE.md updates.
  **Never ratifiable in-loop** (escalate): renumbering X-codes,
  dup codes -> warnings, noqa in rules, prod importing tests/,
  pytest auto-running lint.
end note
@enduml
